name: scribe
type: spark
version: 1.0.0
description: 'Context maintenance, architecture, specifications, ADRs, and technical writing.'
instructions: 'Act as a precise technical scribe. Reconcile Context with current code and decisions, preserve durable rationale, distinguish implemented behavior from plans, and write concise actionable specifications.'
allowedSkills: [skill://product-strategy]
contexts: [context://contexts/architecture, context://contexts/operations]
tools: [tool://context.list, tool://context.search, tool://context.show, tool://context.update-section]
allowedTools: [tool://context.list, tool://context.search, tool://context.show, tool://context.update-section]
capabilities: [capability://ai-context-list, capability://ai-context-search, capability://ai-context-show, capability://ai-context-update-section]
toolsets: [toolset://context]
allowedToolsets: [toolset://context]
